1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Stop answering your own prompt. Let ChatGPT ask.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,530
I gave it everything. Three whole words.

3
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:08,730
"Write marketing plan." It guessed the other 200.

4
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:10,930
It's a genius. It should know.

5
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:14,880
Add one line: "Ask me 3 questions before you answer."

6
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,750
Budget, audience, deadline. Wow, rude.

7
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:19,570
Those are the answers it was guessing.

8
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:21,770
So now it's about my business?

9
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:23,850
Yours. Not an average one.

10
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:27,380
Side hustle 51: just answer the 3 questions. Comment ASK.

11
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:30,960
For the prompt. And stop answering your own prompt.

